            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0603" n="515" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg515"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1560: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-04-08T15:00:00-05:00">April 8, 1933—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. The following telegram has just been received from Geneva:</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of telegram No. 167, April 7, 9 p.m., from the Minister in
                    Switzerland, printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>]</p>
                <pb facs="0604" n="516" xml:id="pg516"/>
                <p>As this appears to offer a reasonable solution of the difficulty, you are
                    authorized to discuss it with President Olaya and to say that the Department
                    very much hopes that he will find it possible to accept.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
